# RESETIUS |   Axiom C255X
# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS | 
# RESETIUS | X=XG+@.987X[\120<1F-<1F-<1F-<1F-<1F-<1F/120+<1F+<1F+<1F+++++++<1F+<1F+<1F]
# RESETIUS |   }
